==Slovene==

===Phrase===
{{head|sl|phrase}}
# literally: ''peaceful Bosnia''
# a locution used to settle a debate
#: ''Kar pusti vse skupaj, pa '''mirna Bosna'''.'' (Just leave everything as it is, and we don't bring it up any more.) ''Tako bo, kot sem rekel in '''mirna Bosna'''.'' (We'll do it my way, end of debate.)